      "title": "8 phase-shifted LEDs",
      "body": "One shared 8-bit carrier, offset by <b>32 counts</b> per LED: eight comparators <code>(pwm_cnt + 32·i) &lt; duty</code>, each into an output flop.",
      "narrate": "Eight comparators share one PWM counter, each offset by 32 counts, so the LEDs fire in a staggered ripple."
